OL,3,GNEWSAThousands join stem cell register
OL,4,Ato help save baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince an appeal was put out by charity
OL,7,FDKMS UK, staff said they saw their
OL,8,Fbusiest 24-hour-period for several
OL,9,Fyears, with nearly 10,000 people
OL,10,Frequesting a test kit to join the
OL,11,Fregister. Ellis's parents added it was
OL,12,F"just as important" other patients
OL,13,Fcould be helped.
